### SmartPark API - manual requests
### Run with the VS Code "REST Client" extension (humao.rest-client) or IntelliJ's HTTP Client.
### Start the server first:  cd smartpark-server ; ..\mvnw.cmd spring-boot:run
### NOTE: the write requests below change data in smartpark_db.

@base = http://localhost:8080
@admin = admin
@entry = entry1
@exit = exit1

### Health
GET {{base}}/api/health

### ------------------------------------------------------------ categories

### List categories
GET {{base}}/api/categories

### Get one category
GET {{base}}/api/categories/car

### Add a category (ADMIN)
POST {{base}}/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json
X-Operator: {{admin}}

{ "categoryName": "Light truck", "description": "Small trucks", "compatibleSlotTypes": ["LARGE"] }

### Update a category (ADMIN)
PUT {{base}}/api/categories/LIGHT_TRUCK
Content-Type: application/json
X-Operator: {{admin}}

{ "description": "Small trucks and pick-ups", "compatibleSlotTypes": ["LARGE"] }

### ----------------------------------------------------------------- slots

### All slots
GET {{base}}/api/slots

### Slots accepting motorcycles on floor 0
GET {{base}}/api/slots?category=MOTORCYCLE&floor=0

### Available slots for a car (entry operator's map)
GET {{base}}/api/slots/available?category=CAR

### One slot
GET {{base}}/api/slots/A-01

### Add a slot (ADMIN) - categories derived from slotType
POST {{base}}/api/slots
Content-Type: application/json
X-Operator: {{admin}}

{ "slotCode": "D-01", "slotType": "STANDARD", "floor": 1, "row": "D", "column": 1 }

### Update a slot (ADMIN)
PUT {{base}}/api/slots/D-01
Content-Type: application/json
X-Operator: {{admin}}

{ "slotType": "EV_CHARGING", "floor": 1, "row": "D", "column": 1 }

### Disable a slot (ADMIN)
POST {{base}}/api/slots/D-01/disable
X-Operator: {{admin}}

### Enable a slot (ADMIN)
POST {{base}}/api/slots/D-01/enable
X-Operator: {{admin}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- parking

### Vehicle entry (ENTRY_OPERATOR) -> 201 with the receipt data
POST {{base}}/api/parking/entry
Content-Type: application/json
X-Operator: {{entry}}

{ "vehicleNumber": "WP CAB-1234", "categoryName": "CAR", "slotCode": "A-01" }

### Same slot again -> 409 SLOT_UNAVAILABLE
POST {{base}}/api/parking/entry
Content-Type: application/json
X-Operator: {{entry}}

{ "vehicleNumber": "WP XYZ-9999", "categoryName": "CAR", "slotCode": "A-01" }

### Exit gate search -> session + slot
GET {{base}}/api/parking/active/WPCAB1234

### Confirm departure (EXIT_OPERATOR)
POST {{base}}/api/parking/exit
Content-Type: application/json
X-Operator: {{exit}}

{ "vehicleNumber": "WP CAB-1234" }

### -------------------------------------------------------------- monitoring

### Currently parked vehicles
GET {{base}}/api/parking/sessions/active

### History (paged, newest first)
GET {{base}}/api/parking/sessions?status=COMPLETED&page=0&size=20

### Statistics
GET {{base}}/api/statistics

### Operator activity
GET {{base}}/api/activity?username=entry1&limit=20
